Scope: four single-line fixes (two clarity/continuity, two listening), all listed at the foot. No second repair. Every brief item is RESOLVED; the book-end state matches BOOK_MAP §1 and the Book 5 hand-off line by line; the wall ends once on the packet's close; overlap 0 unprotected; gates 0; formula in range.

