- **ch62 l.240** — the repaired clause "a careful man who looked once at a failing frame and never once, after, at him" now agrees with ch55 and ch59 for the evaluation sitting, but it is unbounded, and ch56 l.125 has Vastin "turn his eyes on Cael" at the interview the next morning (the same interview the sentence cites for its twelfth question). One phrase bounds it to the sitting.
