+- The map records now have two distinct inherited states: Karis marks the registry's printed sheet with *ridge* and *Shelf; a pine; water at 36*; Lira records *Ridge: one horse, three boxes by hand. Scree: by hand again. Shelf.* in her own book. The printed sheet and Ternhall straightedge remain with Karis's middle box.
